{
  "uid": "user-activity",
  "title": "User Activity Trace",
  "description": "Jejak aktivitas pengguna domain di srv1/client1 + Samba AD + Keycloak, dan skor CIS per host.",
  "tags": [
    "iam-lab"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "30s",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "host",
        "label": "Host",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "loki"
        },
        "query": {
          "qryType": 1,
          "query": "label_values({job=\"host\"}, host)",
          "refId": "LokiVariableQueryEditor-VariableQuery"
        },
        "definition": "label_values({job=\"host\"}, host)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        },
        "sort": 1,
        "regex": ""
      },
      {
        "name": "user",
        "label": "User",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "loki"
        },
        "query": {
          "qryType": 1,
          "query": "label_values({job=\"host\", host=~\"$host\"}, user)",
          "refId": "LokiVariableQueryEditor-VariableQuery"
        },
        "definition": "label_values({job=\"host\", host=~\"$host\"}, user)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        },
        "sort": 1,
        "regex": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Cara memakai dashboard ini & discovery (Logs Drilldown)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "targets": [],
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Pilih **host** dan **user** di atas (daftar diisi otomatis dari label Loki — user baru muncul begitu ia beraktivitas). Untuk *discovery* bebas tanpa menulis kueri: menu **Drilldown → Logs** (Logs Drilldown) → pilih layanan/`job=host` → telusuri tab **Labels** (`host`, `user`, `event`, `source`), **Fields** (`cmd`, `exe`, `ip`) dan **Patterns**. Klik nilai mana pun untuk menyaring.\n\nSumber: `source=auth` (login SSH/desktop, sudo), `source=audit` (perintah yang dijalankan, perubahan identitas), `source=cis` (hasil CIS Benchmark), `service=samba-dc` (autentikasi & perubahan grup di AD), `service=keycloak` (login SSO)."
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Login sukses (host)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=\"host\", host=~\"$host\", user=~\"$user\", event=\"login_ok\"} [$__range]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "0",
          "unit": "none",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
